# The variables this example reads. Copy to .env, fill in, then load it into your shell
# with `set -a; . ./.env; set +a` - the script reads the environment, not this file.
# .env is excluded by .gitignore - never commit a real token.
#
# Portal -> Credentials -> System -> API Token
# Tokens are short-lived by design; re-copy rather than storing one long term.
BDP_API_TOKEN=
